  a YAML comment to machine-visible top-level keys (disjointness_scope, disjointness_overlap_note), and
  validate_taxonomy.py now checks their presence. No other semantic change from rev2.
revision_note: >-
  rev2 responds to review-F0F1-17-20260911T232603+0800 (verdict revise, score 3.0, HF-07):
  finding 2 removes the black-hole-region clause from the AF-WCC-VAC-GEN conclusion and moves it to
